  "title": "Mid‑Year Refrigerant Management Check-In: Why Facilities Should Reevaluate Their Fixed Automatic Leak Detection Strategy in 2026",
  "summary": "Mid‑2026 is a pivotal moment for facilities to reassess fixed refrigerant leak detection as new regulations and rising refrigerant costs demand sharper visibility and faster response. Strengthening low‑level leak detection and multi‑point refrigeration monitoring helps teams stay ahead of leaks, protect uptime, and build a more resilient refrigerant strategy.",
